ears from delivery for manufacturing defects and component failure under normal use. Keep your proof of purchase and follow the model instructions.</p><a href="/pages/warranty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Warranty &amp; service details ↗</a></div></details><details name="a20-assurance" data-assurance-key="1"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16v12H4z"></path><path d="m4 10 8 4 8-4M8 5h8"></path></svg><span><strong>14-Day Returns</strong><small>Request an eligible return within 14 days after delivery.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>14-Day Returns</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close 14-Day Returns details">×</button></div><p>Contact us for approval and an RMA before shipping. Return eligibility and shipping costs follow the return policy.</p><a href="/pages/return-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the return policy ↗</a></div></details><details name="a20-assurance" data-assurance-key="2"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v10H3zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"></path><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg><span><strong>U.S. Warehouse Delivery</strong><small>Eligible stocked products ship domestically.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>U.S. Warehouse Delivery</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close U.S. Warehouse Delivery details">×</button></div><p>Allow 2 business days for processing, plus an estimated 2–5 business days in transit after dispatch. Business days are Monday–Friday, excluding public holidays. Delivery estimates are not guaranteed.</p><a href="/pages/shipping-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Review shipping details ↗</a></div></details><details name="a20-assurance" data-assurance-key="3"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h18M12 3v18M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"></path></svg><span><strong>Free U.S. Shipping</strong><small>Standard shipping to the contiguous 48 states and DC.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>Free U.S. Shipping</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close Free U.S. Shipping details">×</button></div><p>Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, other U.S. territories, military addresses and destinations outside the U.S. are excluded.</p><a href="/pages/shipping-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See eligibility ↗</a></div></details><details name="a20-assurance" data-assurance-key="4"><summary><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="assurance-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v12H8l-4 4zM8 9h8M8 13h5"></path></svg><span><strong>Product Support</strong><small>Help with product selection, setup and use.</small></span><span class="assurance-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="assurance-panel"><div class="assurance-panel-heading"><strong>Product Support</strong><button type="button" class="assurance-close" aria-label="Close Product Support details">×</button></div><p>Tell us the model and your question. For an order or service issue, include your order number and clear photos where useful.</p><a href="/pages/support-a20" target="_blank" rel="noopener">A20 product support ↗</a></div></details></div></div></div>
