    <div class="intro content" id="features"><p class="eyebrow">A20 / ON THE ROAD</p><h2 class="features-title">Product Features</h2><p class="lead">A jump-start without a second car, plus USB charging and a light for after dark.</p></div>
    <div id="feature-content" aria-busy="false"><section data-group="01" id="feature-01" aria-label="A20 product introduction" class="feature-opening"><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Product introduction image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-01.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — Product introduction" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></section><section data-group="02" id="feature-02" aria-label="Get back to your day." class="feature-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / GET A JUMP</p><h2>Get back to your day.</h2><p>A dead battery doesn’t have to leave you waiting for another car. A20 delivers 1,500A of peak current for compatible 12V vehicles with engines up to 6.0L gas or 3.0L diesel.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Starting power image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-03.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — Starting power" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></section><section data-group="03" id="feature-03" aria-label="Less guesswork under the hood." class="feature-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / SMART CLAMPS</p><h2>Less guesswork under the hood.</h2><p>Check the smart clamp status lights before you start. The included clamps have built-in reverse-polarity and short-circuit protection.</p></div><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Smart clamp protection image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-09.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — Smart clamp protection" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></section><section data-group="04" id="feature-04" aria-label="Keep a jump-start in your glove box." class="storage-section"><div class="storage-layout"><div class="storage-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / EASY TO STOW</p><h2>Keep a jump-start<br>in your glove box.</h2><p>At just 0.9 lb, A20 is easy to tuck into a glove box or center console. Keep it with your driving essentials, without giving up trunk space.</p></div><div class="storage-image"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Portable storage image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-gallery-06.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1000" height="1000" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — Portable storage" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></div></section><section data-group="05" id="feature-05" aria-label="Useful between jump-starts, too." class="feature-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / CHARGE &amp; LIGHT</p><h2>Useful between jump-starts, too.</h2><p>Charge your phone through the USB outputs, or turn on the LED for a better look under the hood after dark. Choose steady, flashing or SOS mode.</p></div><div class="feature-pair"><div class="pair-tabs" aria-label="Choose a feature"><button type="button" aria-controls="feature-05-a" aria-pressed="true">Phone charging</button><button type="button" aria-controls="feature-05-b" aria-pressed="false">LED flashlight</button></div><div class="pair-track" id="pair-05" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Phone charging and LED flashlight"><article class="feature-card" id="feature-05-a"><h3 class="card-title"><span class="card-number">01</span>Phone charging</h3><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge USB charging image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-04.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — USB charging" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></article><article class="feature-card" id="feature-05-b"><h3 class="card-title"><span class="card-number">02</span>LED flashlight</h3><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge LED lighting image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-08.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — LED lighting" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></article></div><div class="pair-controls"><p class="pair-hint"><span class="pair-hint-desktop">Drag or use the arrows</span><span class="pair-hint-mobile">Swipe to explore</span></p><span class="pair-counter" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">1 / 2</span><div class="pair-arrows"><button type="button" aria-label="Previous feature" aria-controls="pair-05" disabled="">←</button><button type="button" aria-label="Next feature" aria-controls="pair-05">→</button></div></div></div></section><section data-group="06" id="feature-06" aria-label="Check the charge. Then hit the road." class="feature-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">05 / CHECK &amp; RECHARGE</p><h2>Check the charge.<br>Then hit the road.</h2><p>The digital display shows how much charge is left. Top off the 8,000mAh battery before a trip, and recharge after use so it’s ready for the next drive.</p></div><div class="feature-pair"><div class="pair-tabs" aria-label="Choose a feature"><button type="button" aria-controls="feature-06-a" aria-pressed="true">Temperature range</button><button type="button" aria-controls="feature-06-b" aria-pressed="false">8,000mAh battery</button></div><div class="pair-track" id="pair-06" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Temperature range and 8,000mAh battery"><article class="feature-card" id="feature-06-a"><h3 class="card-title"><span class="card-number">01</span>Temperature range</h3><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Temperature conditions image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-05.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — Temperature conditions" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></article><article class="feature-card" id="feature-06-b"><h3 class="card-title"><span class="card-number">02</span>8,000mAh battery</h3><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Capacity image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-07.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — Capacity" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></article></div><div class="pair-controls"><p class="pair-hint"><span class="pair-hint-desktop">Drag or use the arrows</span><span class="pair-hint-mobile">Swipe to explore</span></p><span class="pair-counter" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">1 / 2</span><div class="pair-arrows"><button type="button" aria-label="Previous feature" aria-controls="pair-06" disabled="">←</button><button type="button" aria-label="Next feature" aria-controls="pair-06">→</button></div></div></div><p class="support-text">Discharge temperature: −4°F to 140°F (−20°C to 60°C). Charging and storage limits differ; see the A20 manual.</p></section><section data-group="07" id="feature-07" aria-label="In the box" class="feature-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">06 / WHAT’S INCLUDED</p><h2>In the box</h2><p>A20 comes with smart jumper clamps, a USB-C charging cable and a user manual. Get familiar with the kit at home, before you need it on the road.</p></div><div class="instructions-layout"><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge In the box image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-11.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — In the box" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><details class="starting-details"><summary><span>How to jump-start your vehicle<p class="details-caption">See the connection steps</p></span><span class="details-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="starting-content"><p class="steps-note">Read the model instructions before use. Check vehicle compatibility and follow the smart clamp indicators.</p><div class="image-module"><button class="image-button" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Starting procedure image"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-orange-aplus-10.webp' | asset_url | json }} width="1200" height="492" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange 8000mAh — Starting procedure" draggable="false"><span class="zoom-label" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div></div></details></div></section></div>
<section class="pdp-section preparation" id="before-use"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE THE FIRST START</p><h2>Before you need it.</h2><p class="section-intro">Keep the kit charged and read the model instructions before you need it.</p><div class="preparation-grid"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Check the unit</h3><p>Charge before use and inspect the unit, supplied clamp and cables.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Confirm 12V fit</h3><p>Check the vehicle battery, engine reference and model instructions.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Follow the clamp</h3><p>Connect in the specified order and confirm the correct status indication.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">04</span><h3>Keep it ready</h3><p>Disconnect as directed after starting, recharge after use and store dry.</p></article></div><a class="text-link" href="#manuals">Read the model instructions →</a></section><section class="pdp-section video-preview"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEE IT IN USE</p><h2>See how the A20 clamps on to a real car battery</h2><p class="section-intro">Canyon Life on Amazon Live</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cZLH2Q9gKlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the product video ↗</a></div><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cZLH2Q9gKlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Watch the A20 product video"><img src={{ 'sn-a20-v8-suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-demo-poster.webp' | asset_url | json }} alt="A20 product video" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></a></section><section class="pdp-section detail-grid" id="box"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DETAILS, TOGETHER</p><h2>In the box</h2><p class="section-intro">Keep the supplied items together and read the instructions before first use.</p><a class="text-link" href="#manuals">Manuals &amp; product support →</a></div><div><ul class="package-list"><li data-capacity-match=""><span class="item-number">01</span><span>A20 main unit x1</span></li><li data-capacity-match=""><span class="item-number">02</span><span>Smart clamp x1</span></li><li data-capacity-match=""><span class="item-number">03</span><span>USB cable x1</span></li><li data-capacity-match=""><span class="item-number">04</span><span>Manual x1</span></li><li data-capacity-match=""><span class="item-number">05</span><span>Color box x1</span></li></ul><p class="package-note" id="box-quantity-note">Package contents listed per unit.</p></div></section><section class="pdp-section detail-grid" id="specs"><div><p class="eyebrow">KNOW YOUR A20</p><h2>Made clear. Down to the details.</h2><p class="section-intro">Choose a capacity above to view its matching specifications.</p><a class="text-link" href="#manuals">Manuals &amp; documents →</a></div><div><dl class="spec-table"><div data-capacity-match="8000mAh"><dt>Rated capacity</dt><dd>8,000mAh</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="8000mAh"><dt>Rated energy</dt><dd>29.6Wh</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="8000mAh"><dt>Starting current</dt><dd>750A</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="8000mAh"><dt>Peak current</dt><dd>1500A</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="12000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Rated capacity</dt><dd>12,000mAh</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="12000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Rated energy</dt><dd>44.4Wh</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="12000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Starting current</dt><dd>1500A</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="12000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Peak current</dt><dd>3000A</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="16000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Rated capacity</dt><dd>16,000mAh</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="16000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Rated energy</dt><dd>59.2Wh</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="16000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Starting current</dt><dd>2000A</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="16000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Peak current</dt><dd>4000A</dd></div><div data-capacity-match=""><dt>Cycle-life reference</dt><dd>300 cycles</dd></div></dl><details class="more-details"><summary>More specifications</summary><dl class="spec-table"><div data-capacity-match="8000mAh"><dt>Shipping weight</dt><dd>0.75kg</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="12000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Shipping weight</dt><dd>0.83kg</dd></div><div data-capacity-match="16000mAh" hidden=""><dt>Shipping weight</dt><dd>0.94kg</dd></div><div data-capacity-match=""><dt>Input</dt><dd>USB-C: 5V/2A, 9V/2A</dd></div><div data-capacity-match=""><dt>Output</dt><dd>2x USB-A: 5V/2A (3A max)</dd></div><div data-capacity-match=""><dt>Discharge temperature</dt><dd>-20 C to 60 C</dd></div></dl></details><details class="more-details" id="manuals"><summary>Manuals &amp; documents</summary><div class="manual-list"><div data-capacity-match="8000mAh"><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0903/4815/9271/files/SUNTNEEW_CY-A20-8000MAH_English_Product_Pack.pdf?v=1786349789" target="_blank" rel="noopener">8,000mAh product pack (PDF) ↗</a></div><div data-capacity-match="12000mAh" hidden=""><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0903/4815/9271/files/SUNTNEEW_CY-A20-12000MAH_English_Product_Pack.pdf?v=1786349789" target="_blank" rel="noopener">12,000mAh product pack (PDF) ↗</a></div><div data-capacity-match="16000mAh" hidden=""><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0903/4815/9271/files/SUNTNEEW_CY-A20-16000MAH_English_Product_Pack.pdf?v=1786349789" target="_blank" rel="noopener">16,000mAh product pack (PDF) ↗</a></div><a href="/pages/support-a20" target="_blank" rel="noopener">A20 instructions &amp; product support ↗</a></div></details></div></section><section class="pdp-section" id="reviews"><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER REVIEWS</p><h2>From our customers.</h2><p class="section-intro">Read A20 customer feedback before choosing your kit.</p>{% for block in section.blocks %}{% render block %}{% endfor %}</section><section class="support-section" id="support"><div class="pdp-section support-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">SUNTNEEW, AFTER THE SALE</p><span class="warranty-number">5<small>YEAR</small></span><h2>Here for the road ahead.</h2><p class="support-copy">Five years from delivery for manufacturing defects and component failure under normal use. Keep your proof of purchase and follow the model instructions.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pages/warranty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Warranty &amp; service details ↗</a></div><div class="support-links"><a href="/pages/shipping-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><strong>Free U.S. standard shipping.</strong><small>To the contiguous 48 states and Washington, DC.</small></span><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/return-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><strong>14 days to request a return.</strong><small>Contact us for approval before returning eligible items.</small></span><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/support-a20" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><strong>Questions now. Support later.</strong><small>Help with product selection, setup and use.</small></span><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Talk to SuntNeew</strong><span class="link-arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class="pdp-section detail-grid" id="faq"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU GO</p><h2>A few useful answers.</h2><p class="section-intro">More questions about your A20?</p><a class="text-link" href="/pages/support-a20" target="_blank" rel="noopener">We’re here to help ↗</a></div><div class="faq-group"><details><summary>How many A20 variants are there?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Choose from 8,000mAh Orange or Red, 12,000mAh Orange and 16,000mAh Orange. The price and stock status follow your selection.</p></div></details><details><summary>How should I choose an A20 capacity?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Start with the selected capacity's rated energy and peak current, then confirm 12V vehicle fit in the product manual. Do not choose from a generic engine-size promise alone.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can the A20 charge a phone?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. The A20 has two USB-A outputs for everyday device charging, in addition to its USB-C input.</p></div></details><details><summary>What should I do before jump-starting?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Read the product manual, confirm correct clamp polarity, and follow the vehicle manufacturer's instructions. Product condition and vehicle battery condition affect results.</p></div></details></div></section><section class="closing-banner"><div><p class="eyebrow">SUNTNEEW / A20</p><h2>Ready for what comes next.</h2></div><a class="orange-link" href="#gallery">Choose your A20 ↑</a></section>
